 sweater with text on the front, paired with a short, white, pleated skirt that exposes her long legs. Her outfit is complemented by white, ribbed knee socks and blue Adidas sneakers with white stripes. She holds a small, blue handbag with a white floral embellishment in her right hand. The doorway is wooden, and the background reveals a lush, green garden with trees and grass, visible through a large window. The lighting is natural, casting a soft, even light on the subject. The overall style is casual and relaxed, with a mix of sporty and preppy elements. The photograph is crisp and clear, with a shallow depth of field that keeps the subject in sharp focus while the background is slightly blurred. The color palette is predominantly soft and natural, with the greenery and wooden elements adding warmth to the scene."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 39, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [25], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [446.0879211425781, 678.31982421875], "pos": [426.894287109375, 981.109375], "widgets_values": ["861e5fa987f7be70affe2a0be97a8458ce1f8073d3ec8055fe72707bd7c19967.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataIm